# Ubuntu White Three-Copy Model

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    L[Logical File] --> C1[Physical Copy 1]
    L --> C2[Physical Copy 2]
    L --> C3[Physical Copy 3]
    C1 --> R1[18 ratings + health]
    C2 --> R2[18 ratings + health]
    C3 --> R3[18 ratings + health]
    C1 --> H[Independent content identity]
    C2 --> H
    C3 --> H
    H --> C[COMB comparison]
```

The three Sense layers are therefore **copies of the file**, rather than metadata-only layers.
